19ve tried this month.\u201d<br>Ladies Gamers<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627320/7133f64ea8adde0d99a3675f9cada929ada2727a/ss_7133f64ea8adde0d99a3675f9cada929ada2727a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746077505","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627320/7133f64ea8adde0d99a3675f9cada929ada2727a/ss_7133f64ea8adde0d99a3675f9cada929ada2727a.600x338.jpg?t=1746077505"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627320/194a3d92075a428254597c6ada3948b6f1ff1492/ss_194a3d92075a428254597c6ada3948b6f1ff1492.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746077505","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627320/194a3d92075a428254597c6ada3948b6f1ff1492/ss_194a3d92075a428254597c6ada3948b6f1ff1492.600x338.jpg?t=1746077505"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627320/fbd97ce8271e78d1d12b827ad0594eb76a409f48/ss_fbd97ce8271e78d1d12b827ad0594eb76a409f48.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746077505","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627320/fbd97ce8271e78d1d12b827ad0594eb76a409f48/ss_fbd97ce8271e78d1d12b827ad0594eb76a409f48.600x338.jpg?t=1746077505"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627320/7e1c3398a1569fc27a9a8f218f89762639369951/ss_7e1c3398a1569fc27a9a8f218f89762639369951.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746077505","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627320/7e1c3398a1569fc27a9a8f218f89762639369951/ss_7e1c3398a1569fc27a9a8f218f89762639369951.600x338.jpg?t=1746077505"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627320/18a9c62844096b03978442ced7b36073fce131cd/ss_18a9c62844096b03978442ced7b36073fce131cd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746077505","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627320/18a9c62844096b03978442ced7b36073fce131cd/ss_18a9c62844096b03978442ced7b36073fce131cd.600x338.jpg?t=1746077505"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627320/463886903247cbbada9ccbff55a40ad44ea1ba01/ss_463886903247cbbada9ccbff55a40ad44ea1ba01.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746077505","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627320/463886903247cbbada9ccbff55a40ad44ea1ba01/ss_463886903247cbbada9ccbff55a40ad44ea1ba01.600x338.jpg?t=1746077505"}],"short_description":"Cloudy with a Chance of Kittens is a cozy, Suika-inspired, puzzle game where adorable, dessert-shaped cats fall from the clouds. Unlock power-ups, set up satisfying chains and combos, brave obstacles and cheeky weather twists. Play to relax or compete to leave your pawprint on our leaderboards. \ud83d\udc08","steam_appid":3627320,"support_info":{"email":"hello@ninjachompek.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"demo","website":"https://ninjachompek.com/"}